    <!--
      Rotating product carrier
      ------------------------
      SDF-only circular motion strategy:
      - The product shapes are placed as collision/visual elements inside one dynamic link.
      - The VelocityControl system gives this compound product link an angular velocity.
      - This makes the products visually circulate around the ring for camera detection.

